# Copy to `.env` and fill in. On a host, set the same variables in its build environment.

# Your production domain. Feeds canonical + OG URLs, JSON-LD, the sitemap, robots.txt and
# llms.txt — setting it once fixes all of them. Defaults to https://david-corella.github.io
# (see astro.config.mjs). GitHub Pages builds read this from the workflow env if you set it.
SITE_URL=https://david-corella.github.io

# --- Contact form -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# None. The site is fully static and the contact form composes a `mailto:` in the browser
# (see src/components/Sections/Contact/Form.astro), so there is no server route and no mail keys
# to configure. The destination inbox is `author.email` in src/config/siteData.json.ts.
